<title>POLAND: HANDLOWY TO UP DEPOSIT, CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>HANDLOWY TO UP DEPOSIT, CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Handlowy SA will raise its deposit rates and its floating base rate for zloty credits by between 0.5 and one percentage point as of Friday, August 8, the bank's board said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Handlowy's new base credit rate will rise to 25.5 percent from 24.75 percent.</p>
<p>On Monday the central bank increased its lombard rate by two points to 27 percent and its discount rate by 2.5 points to 24.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
